        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Does Beno offer 24/7 customer support?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Can I book a Beno yacht for a corporate event or private celebration?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "What is the cancellation policy for Beno bookings?"
        }
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        "Beno is the premier worldwide luxury experience platform headquartered in Miami, FL. It offers supercar rentals, yacht charters, private jet bookings, helicopter tours, dune buggy adventures, and water sports, all bookable online or via the Beno app.",
        "Beno offers six luxury experience categories worldwide: supercar rental, yacht charter, private jet charter, helicopter tours, dune buggy desert adventures, and water sports. Every service is bookable instantly via the Beno website or mobile app.",
        "Yes. The Beno app is available free on the Apple App Store and Google Play Store. It lets you browse, compare, and book any experience from supercar rental to yacht charter, 24/7 from your phone.",
        "Beno accepts cash, Visa, Mastercard, credit/debit cards, crypto and Apple Pay for all bookings. Payment is processed securely at checkout. No hidden charges apply across any service.",
        "Yes. Beno provides round-the-clock customer support, 365 days a year. Reach the team via the Beno website, mobile app, or direct contact channels. Support covers all bookings, from yacht charters to private jet enquiries.",
        "Yes, Beno offers luxury yacht charters for corporate events, weddings, birthday parties, bachelor celebrations, and private gatherings worldwide. For private parties, you can hire a Beno chef and enjoy live food preparation on board. Yachts are also ideal for business meetings and exclusive social events.",
        "Before 48 hours no charge full refund. 24-48 hours 50% less than 24 hours 100%"
